---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy - Ohr HaTorah" pageTitle="Privacy Policy">
  <p class="intro-text"><strong>Last updated: May 27, 2026</strong></p>

  <section class="section">
    <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
    <p>Ohr HaTorah may collect information you choose to provide through this site, such as your name, email address, phone number, and messages submitted through contact or subscription forms.</p>
    <p>The site may also use basic technical information, such as browser type, device information, and security logs, to help operate and protect the website.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h3>How We Use Information</h3>
    <p>We use submitted information to respond to inquiries, send congregation updates when requested, coordinate visits or services, improve the website, and protect the site from misuse.</p>
    <p>We do not sell personal information or share it for targeted advertising.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h3>Service Providers</h3>
    <p>We may use trusted service providers for website hosting, email delivery, analytics, security, or similar operations. These providers are expected to use information only as needed to provide their services.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h3>Cookies And Local Storage</h3>
    <p>The site may use cookies or local storage for basic functionality, security, and administrative sessions. We do not use this site for targeted advertising.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h3>Your Choices</h3>
    <p>You may contact us to request access, correction, or deletion of personal information you have provided, subject to legal, security, and operational limits. You may also ask to stop receiving congregation updates.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>Questions about this Privacy Policy may be sent to <a href="mailto:OhrHaTorahOC@gmail.com">OhrHaTorahOC@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .intro-text {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
